{"t":"BALL","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Ball Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","employees":16000,"hq":"Westminster, CO, United States","website":"https://www.ball.com","summary_en":"Ball Corporation supplies aluminum packaging products for the beverage, personal care, and household products industries in the United States, Brazil, and internationally. The company manufactures and sells aluminum beverage containers to fillers of carbonated soft drinks, beer, energy drinks, and other beverages. It manufactures and sells extruded aluminum aerosol containers, recloseable aluminum bottles, aluminum cups, and aluminum slugs. The company was founded in 1880 and is headquartered in Westminster, Colorado.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Ball Corporation은 미국, 브라질 및 전 세계의 음료, 개인 위생용품, 가정용품 산업에 알루미늄 포장 제품을 공급합니다. 이 회사는 탄산청량음료, 맥주, 에너지드링크 및 기타 음료의 충전재로 사용되는 알루미늄 음료 용기를 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 압출 알루미늄 에어로졸 용기, 재밀봉 가능한 알루미늄 병, 알루미늄 컵, 알루미늄 슬러그를 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 1880년에 설립되었으며 콜로라도주 웨스트민스터에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":65.35,"mcap":17010051072.0,"pe":32.839195,"fpe":14.6094885,"peg":1.2289,"ps":1.1238885,"pb":2.9948215,"ev_ebitda":11.517,"div":1.23,"beta":0.95,"hi52":69.58,"lo52":46.65},"fin":{"rev":15134999552.0,"rev_g":0.239,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.17839001,"op":0.0958,"net":0.035150003,"roe":0.094890006,"fcf":263500000.0,"cash":415000000.0,"debt":7639000064.0,"de":133.084,"eps":1.99,"feps":4.47312},"own":{"short":0.0376,"inst":0.94962996,"insider":0.00262},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":72.61538,"median":74.0,"high":80.0,"low":63.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.71429,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":8,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":9,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05",